  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271500</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あれって……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait, is that...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271568</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ねーねー、
もう、おしまい？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Aww, are we finished already?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271632</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もっと、遊んでよー！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I wanna play more!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271720</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さっきの
ばたばたぱんち！
もう１回見せてよー</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Come on, show me that
Slap-Slap-Punch move again...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271800</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ボクたちの心配は
杞憂だったみたいだけド……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Well, it didn't turn out
how we had feared, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271888</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うん、あんな川に
張り出してたら
落ちちゃうんじゃ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, it looks like he's going
to fall into the stream, and...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272152</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>（ガ、ガキと思って、失敗しただ。
さすがに、あの人数相手じゃ、
分が悪過ぎただーよ……）</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>(I underestimated these brats...
There are just too many of 'em...)</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272152</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>（こ、ここまで逃げてきて、
気絶したフリしとるっつーに……）</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>(I m-managed to give 'em the
slip and pretend to faint, but...)</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272152</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>（ば、場所が悪かっただ……。
そんろそんろ、限界が……、
ち、近いだーよ……）</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>(I've done picked the wrong
spot. Not much longer now,
and I'll be over the edge...)</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272220</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>へん！
タンス野郎が
ざまぁねぇな！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ha! Serves you right,
you closet freak!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272292</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もう、&lt;Dio&gt;！
ほら、助けに行くよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Stop it, &lt;Dio&gt;! We
have to help him!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
